1
00:00:01,007 --> 00:00:02,297
Chudelkin: I SWEAR, MILADY,

2
00:00:02,297 --> 00:00:04,137
I WILL NOT LET YOU DOWN.

3
00:00:04,137 --> 00:00:05,387
HUP!

4
00:00:05,387 --> 00:00:07,937
I AM RESOLUTE AND ENERGIZED!

5
00:00:07,937 --> 00:00:13,317
I AM MOTIVATED,
AND I AM INVINCIBLE!

6
00:00:13,317 --> 00:00:17,737
SYSTEM CALL!

7
00:00:17,737 --> 00:00:24,237
GENERATE THERMAL ELEMENT!

8
00:00:27,117 --> 00:00:28,207
( all gasp )

9
00:00:28,207 --> 00:00:31,037
♪

10
00:00:51,057 --> 00:00:52,437
( singing in Japanese )

11
00:00:52,437 --> 00:00:55,187
♪

12
00:02:11,677 --> 00:02:13,967
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

13
00:02:21,227 --> 00:02:23,147
♪

14
00:02:28,687 --> 00:02:30,647
( flames whooshing )

15
00:02:36,697 --> 00:02:37,697
( all gasp )

16
00:02:39,117 --> 00:02:40,577
Alice: I HAD NO IDEA

17
00:02:40,577 --> 00:02:42,457
HE COULD CONJURE SUCH SPELLS.

18
00:02:42,457 --> 00:02:43,917
I UNDERESTIMATED HIM.

19
00:02:43,917 --> 00:02:48,507
THAT FIRE GIANT IS A BEING
MADE ENTIRELY OF MAGIC.

20
00:02:48,507 --> 00:02:50,917
MY FLOWERS CANNOT DESTROY
SUCH A THING,

21
00:02:50,917 --> 00:02:53,637
AND I DOUBT THEY COULD
HOLD IT OFF FOR VERY LONG.

22
00:02:53,637 --> 00:02:56,717
Kirito: HOW LONG? I MEAN,
WE DON’T NEED THAT MUCH TIME,

23
00:02:56,717 --> 00:02:58,847
JUST ENOUGH
TO GET UP CLOSE TO CHUDELKIN.

24
00:02:58,847 --> 00:03:03,557
Alice: FOR TEN SECONDS, NO MORE,
PERHAPS LESS THAN THAT.

25
00:03:03,557 --> 00:03:07,777
STILL, YOU’RE RIGHT. I’LL DRAW
ITS ATTENTION WHILE YOU ATTACK,

26
00:03:07,777 --> 00:03:10,397
BUT DO NOT ADVANCE TOO FAR.

27
00:03:10,397 --> 00:03:12,817
THAT IS WHAT THE PONTIFEX
IS WAITING FOR.

28
00:03:12,817 --> 00:03:14,237
Kirito: TEN...

29
00:03:14,237 --> 00:03:15,237
Eugeo: SECONDS?

30
00:03:15,237 --> 00:03:16,527
( both grunt )

31
00:03:16,527 --> 00:03:18,197
( Alice gasps )

32
00:03:20,497 --> 00:03:22,157
( chorus vocalizing )

33
00:03:30,547 --> 00:03:32,007
SWARM, MY FLOWERS!

34
00:03:42,347 --> 00:03:43,477
( gasping )

35
00:03:54,737 --> 00:03:55,857
( Kirito gasps )

36
00:03:55,857 --> 00:03:57,777
♪

37
00:04:02,657 --> 00:04:04,577
( growls )

38
00:04:06,327 --> 00:04:07,747
( woman vocalizing )

39
00:04:09,627 --> 00:04:10,837
GO FOR HER EYES.

40
00:04:10,837 --> 00:04:12,297
Eugeo: YOU GOT IT.

41
00:04:12,297 --> 00:04:13,627
SYSTEM CALL.

42
00:04:14,927 --> 00:04:16,387
DISCHARGE!

43
00:04:17,967 --> 00:04:19,297
Chudelkin: NO, NO, NO, NO!

44
00:04:19,297 --> 00:04:20,887
WATCH OUT, YOUR EMINENCE!

45
00:04:20,887 --> 00:04:22,427
( Administrator sighs )

46
00:04:22,427 --> 00:04:23,557
( Chudelkin laughs )

47
00:04:23,557 --> 00:04:24,687
( Kirito grunts )

48
00:04:24,687 --> 00:04:26,807
( growling )

49
00:04:26,807 --> 00:04:28,437
Eugeo: WHAT’S HE DOING?

50
00:04:28,437 --> 00:04:30,107
( Kirito yelling )

51
00:04:38,367 --> 00:04:39,407
Chudelkin: EH? OHH!

52
00:04:41,487 --> 00:04:44,327
( Kirito yells )

53
00:04:44,327 --> 00:04:45,367
( Chudelkin gasps )

54
00:04:45,367 --> 00:04:46,497
( gags )

55
00:04:49,537 --> 00:04:51,627
( screaming )

56
00:04:56,877 --> 00:04:59,087
( gagging )

57
00:05:02,677 --> 00:05:05,517
EMINENCE.

58
00:05:05,517 --> 00:05:06,187
( plops )

59
00:05:14,687 --> 00:05:17,527
( gasps )

60
00:05:19,487 --> 00:05:20,617
Eugeo: KIRITO.

61
00:05:21,697 --> 00:05:23,327
( Kirito gasping )

62
00:05:25,447 --> 00:05:29,247
Administrator: WELL,
THAT WAS RATHER ANTICLIMACTIC.

63
00:05:29,247 --> 00:05:31,957
I DID GAIN SOME USEFUL
INFORMATION FROM IT, THOUGH,

64
00:05:31,957 --> 00:05:34,707
SO IT’S NOT A TOTAL LOSS.

65
00:05:34,707 --> 00:05:36,047
HOW UNSIGHTLY.

66
00:05:40,507 --> 00:05:41,847
Alice: HEARTLESS CREATURE.

67
00:05:41,847 --> 00:05:43,967
Administrator:
SO, IRREGULAR BOY,

68
00:05:43,967 --> 00:05:46,977
I THINK I’VE FIGURED OUT
THE MYSTERY OF YOU.

69
00:05:46,977 --> 00:05:50,147
AT FIRST, I THOUGHT
I COULDN’T SEE YOUR PROPERTIES

70
00:05:50,147 --> 00:05:54,437
BECAUSE YOU WERE UNREGISTERED,
AN ILLEGITIMATE BIRTH,

71
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:56,067
BUT I WAS WRONG.

72
00:05:56,067 --> 00:05:58,607
YOU’RE HUMAN,
NOT FROM THIS WORLD.

73
00:05:58,607 --> 00:06:00,407
YOU’RE FROM THE OTHER SIDE.

74
00:06:00,407 --> 00:06:02,697
AREN’T YOU?

75
00:06:02,697 --> 00:06:03,827
( Eugeo gasps )

76
00:06:03,827 --> 00:06:05,537
- Kirito: I AM.
- ( Eugeo gasps )

77
00:06:06,867 --> 00:06:08,207
Kirito: SO, WHAT?

78
00:06:08,207 --> 00:06:11,077
YOU DON’T FEEL
THREATENED BY ME, DO YOU?

79
00:06:11,077 --> 00:06:14,587
I GOT THE SAME AUTHORITY LEVEL
AS EVERYONE ELSE.

80
00:06:14,587 --> 00:06:17,627
IT’S NOWHERE NEAR AS HIGH
AS YOURS, THAT’S FOR SURE,

81
00:06:17,627 --> 00:06:18,797
ADMINISTRATOR.

82
00:06:18,797 --> 00:06:20,877
SORRY. QUINELLA.

83
00:06:20,877 --> 00:06:22,967
( Administrator laughs )

84
00:06:22,967 --> 00:06:24,717
OH, THAT LITTLE IMP.

85
00:06:24,717 --> 00:06:27,977
SHE’S FILLED YOUR HEAD
WITH RIDICULOUS STORIES.

86
00:06:27,977 --> 00:06:31,477
WELL, BOY, WHAT ARE YOU
DOING IN MY WORLD?

87
00:06:31,477 --> 00:06:34,357
I DOUBT YOU JUST STUMBLED IN
OUT OF CURIOSITY.

88
00:06:34,357 --> 00:06:35,937
Kirito: YOU’RE RIGHT. I DIDN’T.

89
00:06:35,937 --> 00:06:38,027
YOUR WORLD’S
GONNA END REAL SOON,

90
00:06:38,027 --> 00:06:40,317
AND IT’S GONNA BE
ALL YOUR FAULT.

91
00:06:40,317 --> 00:06:41,907
( Administrator laughs )
I’M SORRY. WHAT?

92
00:06:41,907 --> 00:06:44,777
ARE YOU SAYING I’LL DESTROY IT?

93
00:06:44,777 --> 00:06:45,907
Kirito: PRETTY MUCH.

94
00:06:45,907 --> 00:06:48,077
THE DARK TERRITORY WILL INVADE.

95
00:06:48,077 --> 00:06:50,657
THAT’S WHY YOU MADE
THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS,

96
00:06:50,657 --> 00:06:53,877
TO STOP IT, BUT YOUR FAITH
IN THEM’S YOUR MISTAKE.

97
00:06:53,877 --> 00:06:55,087
THEY WON’T BE ENOUGH.

98
00:06:55,087 --> 00:06:56,457
( Administrator laughs )

99
00:06:56,457 --> 00:06:58,047
THAT SOUNDS
EXACTLY LIKE SOMETHING

100
00:06:58,047 --> 00:06:59,797
THAT LITTLE BRAT WOULD SAY.

101
00:06:59,797 --> 00:07:01,587
HOW PITIFUL,

102
00:07:01,587 --> 00:07:04,887
BOTH HER, FOR BEING SO DESPERATE
TO HAVE ME EXPELLED,

103
00:07:04,887 --> 00:07:07,217
AND YOU, FOR BEING SO GULLIBLE.

104
00:07:07,217 --> 00:07:10,177
Alice: MADAM PONTIFEX,
IF I MAY,

105
00:07:10,177 --> 00:07:12,637
THE ARMY OF THE DARK
HAS GROWN RAPIDLY.

106
00:07:12,637 --> 00:07:14,097
IF THEY INVADE NOW,

107
00:07:14,097 --> 00:07:16,647
THE CURRENT NUMBER OF KNIGHTS
CANNOT WITHSTAND IT.

108
00:07:16,647 --> 00:07:21,697
THE COMMANDER BELIEVED SO,
AS DID VICE COMMANDER FANATIO

109
00:07:21,697 --> 00:07:24,317
AND I, I AS WELL.

110
00:07:24,317 --> 00:07:27,777
WHAT IS YOUR PLAN NOW THAT
THE ORDER OF KNIGHTS IS NO MORE?

111
00:07:27,777 --> 00:07:30,997
DO YOU THINK YOU ALONE
CAN PROTECT THE EMPIRE?

112
00:07:30,997 --> 00:07:33,667
BUT WHAT ANGERS ME MORE
THAN YOUR HUBRIS,

113
00:07:33,667 --> 00:07:36,627
YOU HAVE STOLEN
US KNIGHTS FROM OUR PARENTS,

114
00:07:36,627 --> 00:07:40,007
FROM WIVES AND HUSBANDS,
BROTHERS AND SISTERS.

115
00:07:40,007 --> 00:07:43,087
YOU SEALED AWAY
OUR MEMORIES OF THEM

116
00:07:43,087 --> 00:07:44,927
AND REPLACED THEM WITH LIES

117
00:07:44,927 --> 00:07:47,347
OF BEING SUMMONED
FROM A NONEXISTENT HEAVEN!

118
00:07:48,347 --> 00:07:51,557
PONTIFEX, COULD YOU NOT TRUST US

119
00:07:51,557 --> 00:07:54,517
TO BE LOYAL TO YOU
AND RESPECT YOUR AUTHORITY?

120
00:07:54,517 --> 00:07:56,647
WERE WE SUCH A THREAT TO YOU,

121
00:07:56,647 --> 00:07:59,977
YOU HAD TO SUBMIT US
TO SUCH A MONSTROUS RITUAL

122
00:07:59,977 --> 00:08:02,027
AND FORCE OUR SOULS
INTO OBEDIENCE?!

123
00:08:02,027 --> 00:08:03,397
( Eugeo grunts )

124
00:08:06,987 --> 00:08:08,987
Administrator:
I DO TRUST YOU, THOUGH.

125
00:08:08,987 --> 00:08:10,537
IN FACT, I LOVE YOU.

126
00:08:10,537 --> 00:08:13,707
THE PIETY MODULE
INSTALLED IN YOU KNIGHTS

127
00:08:13,707 --> 00:08:17,457
IS PROOF OF MY LOVE,
A GIFT FROM ME TO YOU ALL.

128
00:08:17,457 --> 00:08:18,877
WHY, THIS LITTLE THING

129
00:08:18,877 --> 00:08:22,127
FREES YOU FROM THE WORRY
AND PAIN OF NORMAL FOLK.

130
00:08:22,127 --> 00:08:26,127
YOU ARE MY BEAUTIFUL DOLLS,
BEAUTIFUL FOR ALL ETERNITY.

131
00:08:26,127 --> 00:08:28,717
Alice: OUT OF ALL
THE KNIGHTS, UNC--

132
00:08:28,717 --> 00:08:33,227
COMMANDER BERCOULI HAS
SHOWN YOU THE DEEPEST LOYALTY,

133
00:08:33,227 --> 00:08:35,437
BUT YOU DO NOT KNOW THE MAN,

134
00:08:35,437 --> 00:08:40,897
EVEN THOUGH HE HAS SERVED YOU
FAITHFULLY FOR 300 LONG YEARS.

135
00:08:40,897 --> 00:08:44,817
DO YOU THINK HE DID NOT SUFFER
ONCE IN ALL THAT TIME?

136
00:08:44,817 --> 00:08:47,777
DID YOU NOT KNOW OF THE PAIN
HE CARRIED IN HIS HEART?

137
00:08:47,777 --> 00:08:50,447
ARE YOU THAT OBLIVIOUS?!

138
00:08:52,367 --> 00:08:54,157
Administrator:
YOU THINK SO LITTLE OF ME.

139
00:08:54,157 --> 00:08:55,577
OF COURSE I KNEW.

140
00:08:55,577 --> 00:08:57,867
THESE THINGS YOU SPEAK OF

141
00:08:57,867 --> 00:09:00,167
DIDN’T START BOTHERING BERCOULI
RECENTLY, THOUGH.

142
00:09:00,167 --> 00:09:02,297
HE BROUGHT THEM UP AGES AGO.

143
00:09:02,297 --> 00:09:05,967
A CENTURY, I THINK?
YES, ABOUT THAT, GIVE OR TAKE.

144
00:09:05,967 --> 00:09:08,587
I COULDN’T WATCH HIM BROOD
OVER SUCH TRIVIALITIES,

145
00:09:08,587 --> 00:09:11,887
SO I FIXED HIM,
RESET HIM, TO BE MORE SPECIFIC.

146
00:09:11,887 --> 00:09:13,517
( laughs )

147
00:09:13,517 --> 00:09:16,017
AND HE WAS NOT THE ONLY ONE.

148
00:09:16,017 --> 00:09:19,147
I RESET EVERY KNIGHT
MORE THAN A CENTURY OLD.

149
00:09:19,147 --> 00:09:21,227
ALL OF THEIR PAINFUL MEMORIES

150
00:09:21,227 --> 00:09:23,937
AND TROUBLING THOUGHTS
WERE WIPED AWAY.

151
00:09:23,937 --> 00:09:26,067
DON’T YOU WORRY, ALICE.

152
00:09:26,067 --> 00:09:28,107
I’LL OVERLOOK
YOUR TRANSGRESSIONS

153
00:09:28,107 --> 00:09:31,447
AND ERASE ALL THE THOUGHTS
THAT MAKE YOU SO MISERABLE, TOO.

154
00:09:31,447 --> 00:09:34,037
BEFORE YOU KNOW IT, YOU’LL GO
BACK TO BEING MY PUPPET

155
00:09:34,037 --> 00:09:36,247
AND HAVE NO NEED TO THINK.

156
00:09:36,247 --> 00:09:37,577
( Eugeo gasps )

157
00:09:37,577 --> 00:09:38,287
( flesh creaks )

158
00:09:39,667 --> 00:09:41,037
Alice: YOU ARE CORRECT.

159
00:09:41,037 --> 00:09:44,087
RIGHT NOW, I FEEL
ENOUGH SADNESS AND PAIN

160
00:09:44,087 --> 00:09:46,127
TO TEAR MY HEART TO PIECES.

161
00:09:46,127 --> 00:09:49,967
HOWEVER, I CHOOSE TO EMBRACE IT.

162
00:09:49,967 --> 00:09:53,887
I DO NOT WISH TO ERASE
WHAT I HAVE NEVER FELT BEFORE.

163
00:09:53,887 --> 00:09:56,597
THIS PAIN SERVES A PURPOSE.

164
00:09:56,597 --> 00:09:58,597
IT REMINDS ME WHAT I AM,

165
00:09:58,597 --> 00:10:02,897
A HUMAN BEING
AND NOT A PUPPET KNIGHT.

166
00:10:02,897 --> 00:10:07,237
MADAM PONTIFEX, I DO
NOT WANT YOUR SO-CALLED LOVE,

167
00:10:07,237 --> 00:10:09,737
AND I DO NOT NEED YOU
TO FIX ME!

168
00:10:09,737 --> 00:10:11,987
Administrator:
I’M SAD TO HEAR THAT.

169
00:10:11,987 --> 00:10:14,787
UNFORTUNATELY,
WHAT YOU WANT DOESN’T MATTER.

170
00:10:14,787 --> 00:10:16,697
AS SOON AS I RESYNTHESIZE YOU--

171
00:10:16,697 --> 00:10:20,077
AND I WILL--THE PESKY FEELINGS
THAT TROUBLE YOU NOW

172
00:10:20,077 --> 00:10:21,957
WILL BE ERASED COMPLETELY.

173
00:10:21,957 --> 00:10:24,667
Kirito: KINDA LIKE WHAT YOU DID
TO YOURSELF WAY BACK WHEN,

174
00:10:24,667 --> 00:10:26,507
HUH, QUINELLA?

175
00:10:28,007 --> 00:10:29,627
Administrator:
WATCH IT, LITTLE BOY.

176
00:10:29,627 --> 00:10:32,887
DREDGING UP THE PAST
IS CONSIDERED QUITE RUDE.

177
00:10:32,887 --> 00:10:36,427
Kirito: WHY? YOU SCARED
THE TRUTH WILL COME OUT?

178
00:10:36,427 --> 00:10:40,637
NO ONE’S GOT THE POWER
TO ERASE THE PAST, NOT EVEN YOU.

179
00:10:40,637 --> 00:10:43,147
YOU WERE BORN A HUMAN
AND RAISED A HUMAN.

180
00:10:43,147 --> 00:10:45,107
AND NO MATTER
HOW MUCH POWER YOU GOT,

181
00:10:45,107 --> 00:10:48,027
THAT’S ONE THING
YOU CAN’T CHANGE, CAN YOU?

182
00:10:48,027 --> 00:10:49,687
Administrator:
I’M NOT QUITE SURE

183
00:10:49,687 --> 00:10:51,197
WHAT YOU’RE GETTING AT,

184
00:10:51,197 --> 00:10:53,197
LITTLE BOY FROM THE OUTER WORLD.

185
00:10:53,197 --> 00:10:55,327
Kirito: ALL YOU WANT
IS TO BE A GOD,

186
00:10:55,327 --> 00:10:57,407
BUT YOU CAN NEVER BE A GOD,
’CAUSE YOU’RE HUMAN.

187
00:10:58,907 --> 00:11:01,667
BEING HUMAN
MEANS YOU MAKE MISTAKES,

188
00:11:01,667 --> 00:11:03,577
AND YOU MADE A BIG ONE.

189
00:11:03,577 --> 00:11:06,997
AT THIS POINT, THERE’S NOTHING
YOU CAN DO TO FIX IT.

190
00:11:06,997 --> 00:11:09,917
YOU GOT
LESS INTEGRITY KNIGHTS NOW.

191
00:11:09,917 --> 00:11:12,967
IF THE DARK TERRITORY INVADES,
WHO’S GONNA STOP ’EM?

192
00:11:12,967 --> 00:11:14,717
THEY’LL DESTROY EVERYTHING.

193
00:11:14,717 --> 00:11:16,177
Administrator:
AND WHO WAS THE ONE

194
00:11:16,177 --> 00:11:18,217
WHO CORRUPTED
SOME OF MY BEST KNIGHTS?

195
00:11:18,217 --> 00:11:19,977
THAT WAS YOU, BOY.

196
00:11:19,977 --> 00:11:22,347
Kirito: IF YOU’RE
ALL THAT’S LEFT AFTER THIS,

197
00:11:22,347 --> 00:11:24,977
MAYBE YOU CAN START OVER
WITH A CLEAN SLATE.

198
00:11:24,977 --> 00:11:26,937
MAYBE THAT’S WHAT
YOU ALWAYS WANTED.

199
00:11:26,937 --> 00:11:29,897
THING IS, IT AIN’T GONNA GO
THE WAY YOU WANT IT.

200
00:11:29,897 --> 00:11:31,817
ON THE OTHER SIDE,

201
00:11:31,817 --> 00:11:33,777
THERE’S THE PEOPLE
WHO CREATED THIS WORLD

202
00:11:33,777 --> 00:11:36,407
AND HAVE FINAL SAY
OVER WHAT HAPPENS TO IT.

203
00:11:36,407 --> 00:11:39,077
WHEN THEY SEE
THE HUMAN EMPIRE FALL,

204
00:11:39,077 --> 00:11:41,367
THEY’LL THINK,
"OH, WELL, THAT DIDN’T WORK.

205
00:11:41,367 --> 00:11:42,657
I GUESS WE’LL START OVER."

206
00:11:42,657 --> 00:11:45,167
AND THEN ONE OF THEM
WILL PUSH A BUTTON,

207
00:11:45,167 --> 00:11:46,957
AND EVERYTHING’LL DISAPPEAR,

208
00:11:46,957 --> 00:11:50,257
THE MOUNTAINS, THE RIVERS...

209
00:11:52,047 --> 00:11:53,547
THE TOWNS...

210
00:11:55,927 --> 00:11:58,757
EVERY PERSON HERE, AND YOU.

211
00:11:58,757 --> 00:12:01,387
THEY’LL ERASE IT ALL
IN THE BLINK OF AN EYE.

212
00:12:01,387 --> 00:12:04,477
( Eugeo gasps )

213
00:12:04,477 --> 00:12:07,017
Administrator: POINT TAKEN.

214
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:10,357
BUT I HAVE A FEELING THE SAME
GOES FOR YOUR WORLD, TOO.

215
00:12:10,357 --> 00:12:12,237
YOU MUST HAVE A CREATOR.

216
00:12:12,237 --> 00:12:14,147
DOES YOUR KIND GRAPPLE
WITH THE THOUGHT

217
00:12:14,147 --> 00:12:17,567
OF LIVING UNDER THE WHIM
OF A HIGHER POWER AS WELL?

218
00:12:17,567 --> 00:12:21,197
DO YOU STRIVE TO PLEASE
THIS BEING, OBEYING ITS LAWS,

219
00:12:21,197 --> 00:12:23,327
HOPING IT WON’T TIRE OF YOU
AND WIPE YOU OUT?

220
00:12:23,327 --> 00:12:25,207
( Kirito gasps )

221
00:12:25,207 --> 00:12:28,167
Administrator: I WOULD BE
SHOCKED IF THAT WERE THE CASE.

222
00:12:28,167 --> 00:12:32,047
AS YOU SAY,
YOUR KIND CREATED OUR WORLD,

223
00:12:32,047 --> 00:12:36,837
AND, IF WE FAIL THEM, THEY
WOULD DELETE US WITHOUT A CARE.

224
00:12:36,837 --> 00:12:39,847
IF THAT IS HOW
YOUR KIND TREAT US, BOY,

225
00:12:39,847 --> 00:12:42,767
THEN YOU DO NOT HAVE
THE RIGHT TO CRITICIZE ME.

226
00:12:42,767 --> 00:12:45,727
I REJECT THEIR AUTHORITY.

227
00:12:45,727 --> 00:12:48,767
I WILL NOT PANDER
TO SELF-PROCLAIMED GODS,

228
00:12:48,767 --> 00:12:52,027
GROVELING FOR THE RIGHT
TO CONTINUE EXISTING.

229
00:12:52,027 --> 00:12:54,147
I REFUTE THEM ALL.

230
00:12:54,147 --> 00:12:56,397
I EXIST FOR ONE REASON ALONE,

231
00:12:56,397 --> 00:12:59,117
TO RULE OVER ALL IN THIS WORLD.

232
00:12:59,117 --> 00:13:03,327
THAT SINGULAR DESIRE IS WHAT
DRIVES ME AND GIVES ME LIFE.

233
00:13:03,327 --> 00:13:06,617
MY LEGS ARE FOR CLIMBING
OVER OTHERS TO GREATER HEIGHTS,

234
00:13:06,617 --> 00:13:09,247
NOT TO BEND AT THE KNEE
IN SUBJUGATION!

235
00:13:09,247 --> 00:13:11,127
( Eugeo gasps )

236
00:13:11,127 --> 00:13:13,377
( Kirito grunts )
AND THEN WHAT?!

237
00:13:13,377 --> 00:13:17,677
ARE YOU GONNA SIT BACK AND LET
THE HUMAN EMPIRE GET DESTROYED?

238
00:13:17,677 --> 00:13:20,047
ARE YOU GONNA WATCH
EVERYTHING BURN,

239
00:13:20,047 --> 00:13:24,347
ALONE ON YOUR TOKEN THRONE,
A QUEEN WITH NO ONE TO RULE?!

240
00:13:24,347 --> 00:13:26,057
Administrator: ON THE CONTRARY.

241
00:13:26,057 --> 00:13:29,557
I WILL NOT ALLOW YOUR KIND
TO RESET THE UNDERWORLD,

242
00:13:29,557 --> 00:13:32,067
NOR WILL I ALLOW
THE FINAL STRESS TEST

243
00:13:32,067 --> 00:13:34,027
TO RUN ITS COURSE, EITHER.

244
00:13:34,027 --> 00:13:38,067
I’VE PREPARED A NEW SACRED ART
TO COUNTER THAT, IN FACT.

245
00:13:38,067 --> 00:13:41,197
SO BE HONORED.
YOU WILL BE WITNESSES,

246
00:13:41,197 --> 00:13:42,947
THE FIRST TO TEST MY CREATION.

247
00:13:42,947 --> 00:13:44,537
Kirito: WHAT CREATION?

248
00:13:46,197 --> 00:13:48,287
Administrator:
THE KNIGHTS WERE A STOPGAP,

249
00:13:48,287 --> 00:13:51,207
AND THEY HAVE SERVED
THEIR PURPOSE WELL.

250
00:13:51,207 --> 00:13:54,297
THE MILITARY FORCE I REQUIRE
SHOULD NOT THINK

251
00:13:54,297 --> 00:13:56,127
OR FEEL OR REMEMBER.

252
00:13:56,127 --> 00:13:58,167
IN BATTLE,
THOSE ARE DISTRACTIONS.

253
00:13:58,167 --> 00:14:00,177
MY PERFECT SOLDIER

254
00:14:00,177 --> 00:14:04,847
RELENTLESSLY MASSACRES
WHATEVER ENEMY STANDS BEFORE IT.

255
00:14:04,847 --> 00:14:09,347
ULTIMATELY, WHAT I REQUIRE
IS NOT HUMAN.

256
00:14:09,347 --> 00:14:12,977
WAKE, AND DESTROY YOUR ENEMY,

257
00:14:12,977 --> 00:14:14,857
MY FAITHFUL SERVANT,

258
00:14:14,857 --> 00:14:16,897
MY SOULLESS EXTERMINATOR!

259
00:14:16,897 --> 00:14:19,237
RELEASE RECOLLECTION!

260
00:14:19,237 --> 00:14:21,407
♪

261
00:14:21,407 --> 00:14:23,027
Eugeo: WH-WHAT’S SHE DONE?!

262
00:14:23,027 --> 00:14:23,737
Alice: IMPOSSIBLE.

263
00:14:39,217 --> 00:14:41,007
( Kirito gasps )

264
00:14:41,007 --> 00:14:42,637
DISCHARGE!

265
00:14:56,267 --> 00:14:58,187
( energy humming )

266
00:15:14,957 --> 00:15:15,957
( Eugeo gasps )

267
00:15:15,957 --> 00:15:17,587
Alice: THIS CAN’T BE.

268
00:15:17,587 --> 00:15:18,797
ALL THOSE WEAPONS?

269
00:15:20,627 --> 00:15:23,217
USING PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL
ON 30 AT ONCE

270
00:15:23,217 --> 00:15:26,257
SHOULD BE IMPOSSIBLE,
EVEN FOR THE PONTIFEX.

271
00:15:26,257 --> 00:15:28,427
IT VIOLATES THE SACRED ARTS.

272
00:15:28,427 --> 00:15:30,097
( Administrator giggles )

273
00:15:30,097 --> 00:15:31,347
( laughs )

274
00:15:31,347 --> 00:15:32,807
( sighs )

275
00:15:32,807 --> 00:15:36,147
AT LONG LAST,
THE POWER I HAVE SOUGHT,

276
00:15:36,147 --> 00:15:38,437
OFFENSIVE MIGHT WITH NO EQUAL,

277
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:40,487
A SOLDIER
THAT WILL FIGHT FOREVER.

278
00:15:40,487 --> 00:15:44,487
NOW, WHAT SHALL I CALL IT?

279
00:15:44,487 --> 00:15:47,117
I KNOW. THE SWORD GOLEM!

280
00:15:49,617 --> 00:15:53,077
Kirito: NO WAY.
IT’S A WALKING SWORD.

281
00:15:54,167 --> 00:15:56,037
♪

282
00:15:59,047 --> 00:16:01,047
Administrator:
EACH ONE OF ITS BLADES

283
00:16:01,047 --> 00:16:04,007
HAS THE PRIORITY LEVEL
OF A DIVINE OBJECT.

284
00:16:04,007 --> 00:16:06,717
I STRETCHED
MY PRECIOUS MEMORY CAPACITY

285
00:16:06,717 --> 00:16:10,927
TO THE LIMIT TO CREATE THIS,
THE ULTIMATE WEAPON.

286
00:16:10,927 --> 00:16:12,557
DO YOU THINK YOU CAN DEFEAT IT?

287
00:16:12,557 --> 00:16:13,347
( Kirito shudders )

288
00:16:13,347 --> 00:16:15,437
( Alice gasping )

289
00:16:15,437 --> 00:16:17,227
( Eugeo gasping )

290
00:16:17,227 --> 00:16:21,727
Administrator: NOW GO FORTH,
AND FIGHT, MY GOLEM.

291
00:16:21,727 --> 00:16:23,437
GO AND ANNIHILATE YOUR ENEMIES!

292
00:16:25,317 --> 00:16:26,987
♪

293
00:16:26,987 --> 00:16:28,157
( clanging )

294
00:16:32,537 --> 00:16:34,247
( Eugeo gasping )

295
00:16:34,247 --> 00:16:35,367
( Alice yelling )

296
00:16:40,997 --> 00:16:41,917
( Eugeo gasps )

297
00:16:47,507 --> 00:16:49,427
( Alice gasping )

298
00:16:57,017 --> 00:16:58,727
( Kirito yelling )

299
00:17:04,357 --> 00:17:05,197
( gags )

300
00:17:07,987 --> 00:17:09,277
( wall clattering )

301
00:17:09,277 --> 00:17:10,367
( gags )

302
00:17:10,367 --> 00:17:12,487
♪

303
00:17:17,997 --> 00:17:20,127
( gasping )

304
00:17:22,247 --> 00:17:23,877
( Eugeo shuddering )

305
00:17:28,257 --> 00:17:29,927
( Administrator laughing )

306
00:17:35,557 --> 00:17:37,637
( clangs )

307
00:17:37,637 --> 00:17:41,267
Kirito: EU-EUGEO...

308
00:17:41,267 --> 00:17:43,187
Charlotte: EUGEO,
USE YOUR DAGGER!

309
00:17:43,187 --> 00:17:44,607
( Eugeo gasps )

310
00:17:44,607 --> 00:17:45,687
Charlotte:
STAB THE LEVITATING DISC!

311
00:17:45,687 --> 00:17:47,147
Eugeo: HUH?

312
00:17:47,147 --> 00:17:49,487
Charlotte:
I’LL BUY YOU SOME TIME.

313
00:17:49,487 --> 00:17:50,527
HURRY!

314
00:17:50,527 --> 00:17:52,447
♪

315
00:18:10,297 --> 00:18:12,217
( hisses )

316
00:18:19,597 --> 00:18:21,517
( magic humming )

317
00:18:24,607 --> 00:18:26,187
( Eugeo gasping )

318
00:18:36,947 --> 00:18:40,537
Charlotte:
THANK GOODNESS. HE MADE IT.

319
00:18:43,837 --> 00:18:48,377
I’M HAPPY I GOT
TO FIGHT WITH YOU

320
00:18:48,377 --> 00:18:50,927
ONE LA...

321
00:19:13,317 --> 00:19:15,697
( pieces clatter )

322
00:19:15,697 --> 00:19:17,077
( Administrator chuckles )

323
00:19:18,407 --> 00:19:20,367
( Kirito groans )

324
00:19:20,367 --> 00:19:23,327
♪

325
00:19:23,327 --> 00:19:24,417
( gasps )

326
00:19:27,457 --> 00:19:28,497
Cardinal: EH?

327
00:19:49,607 --> 00:19:51,107
( Kirito groans )

328
00:19:55,447 --> 00:19:57,197
Alice: KIRITO...

329
00:19:57,197 --> 00:19:59,657
WHO IS THIS PERSON?

330
00:19:59,657 --> 00:20:01,617
Kirito: SHE’S CARDINAL.

331
00:20:01,617 --> 00:20:04,327
SHE’S THE GOOD PONTIFEX
OF THIS WORLD.

332
00:20:04,327 --> 00:20:07,587
200 YEARS AGO,
SHE FOUGHT ADMINISTRATOR,

333
00:20:07,587 --> 00:20:09,797
BUT SHE HAD TO GO INTO HIDING.

334
00:20:09,797 --> 00:20:13,377
SHE SAVED EUGEO AND ME AND
GUIDED US INTO THE CATHEDRAL.

335
00:20:13,377 --> 00:20:14,677
SHE WANTS TO HELP.

336
00:20:14,677 --> 00:20:16,967
NO ONE LOVES THIS WORLD
MORE THAN HER.

337
00:20:16,967 --> 00:20:19,387
Alice: I DON’T DOUBT IT.

338
00:20:19,387 --> 00:20:21,887
I TRUST THE WARMTH OF HER POWER.

339
00:20:21,887 --> 00:20:23,807
THANK YOU FOR HEALING ME,
MILADY.

340
00:20:23,807 --> 00:20:25,137
Cardinal: MM.

341
00:20:26,767 --> 00:20:28,307
( rings clinking )

342
00:20:37,527 --> 00:20:39,197
YOU STUBBORN FOOL.

343
00:20:39,197 --> 00:20:41,697
DID I NOT RELIEVE YOU
OF YOUR DUTIES?

344
00:20:41,697 --> 00:20:45,457
DID I NOT THANK YOU
FOR ALL YOUR HARD WORK?

345
00:20:45,457 --> 00:20:47,667
WHY COULDN’T YOU
JUST STAY ON YOUR BOOKSHELF?

346
00:20:47,667 --> 00:20:49,877
Kirito: I’M SORRY.

347
00:20:49,877 --> 00:20:52,297
DID SHE HAVE A FLUCTLIGHT, TOO?

348
00:20:52,297 --> 00:20:53,507
Cardinal: NO.

349
00:20:53,507 --> 00:20:55,797
TO BORROW A TERM
FROM YOUR WORLD,

350
00:20:55,797 --> 00:20:57,887
CHARLOTTE WAS LIKE AN NPC.

351
00:20:57,887 --> 00:20:59,507
Kirito: W-WAIT. WHAT?

352
00:20:59,507 --> 00:21:00,887
BUT SHE--

353
00:21:00,887 --> 00:21:03,887
SHE RISKED HER LIFE TO SAVE ME.

354
00:21:03,887 --> 00:21:06,937
THAT’S NOT SOMETHING
AN NPC’D DO.

355
00:21:06,937 --> 00:21:10,107
I MEAN, IF SHE DIDN’T
HAVE A SOUL, THEN--

356
00:21:10,107 --> 00:21:14,067
Cardinal: THIS CHILD
HAD BEEN ALIVE FOR 200 YEARS.

357
00:21:14,067 --> 00:21:16,527
SHE WAS MY CONSTANT COMPANION,

358
00:21:16,527 --> 00:21:20,527
AND SHE WATCHED OVER
A NUMBER OF PEOPLE FOR ME.

359
00:21:20,527 --> 00:21:23,447
FOR THE PAST TWO YEARS,
SHE WAS WITH YOU.

360
00:21:23,447 --> 00:21:26,997
AFTER SPENDING
ALL THAT TIME WITH SOMEONE,

361
00:21:26,997 --> 00:21:30,207
ONE DOESN’T NEED
A FLUCTLIGHT TO CARE.

362
00:21:30,207 --> 00:21:33,247
EVEN IF THE NATURE
OF AN INTELLIGENCE

363
00:21:33,247 --> 00:21:36,467
IS JUST A COLLECTION
OF INPUT AND OUTPUT DATA,

364
00:21:36,467 --> 00:21:40,547
IT IS STILL POSSIBLE FOR IT
TO HAVE A TRUE SOUL WITHIN

365
00:21:40,547 --> 00:21:44,267
AND, IN SOME CASES, LOVE.

366
00:21:44,267 --> 00:21:46,557
A CONCEPT
YOU’LL NEVER UNDERSTAND,

367
00:21:46,557 --> 00:21:47,727
AS LONG AS YOU LIVE!

368
00:21:47,727 --> 00:21:51,807
ADMINISTRATOR,
YOU WRETCHED WOMAN!

369
00:21:51,807 --> 00:21:53,817
( Administrator laughing )

370
00:21:53,817 --> 00:21:55,897
( chorus vocalizing )

371
00:22:05,447 --> 00:22:09,537
Singer: ♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

372
00:22:09,537 --> 00:22:11,207
( singing in Japanese )

373
00:22:19,087 --> 00:22:22,547
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

374
00:22:22,547 --> 00:22:24,217
( singing in Japanese )

375
00:22:31,977 --> 00:22:33,937
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪
